&lt;a class=&quot;newpage&quot; href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/nobody-in-their-right-hand&quot;&gt;Nobody in Their Right Mind&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;额外&lt;br /&gt;
→ &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/memebodies&quot;&gt;无名人观察无名人被拒绝的请求&lt;/a&gt; ←&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
